 rust/kernel/fs.rs               | 25 ++++++++++
 rust/kernel/fs/inode.rs         | 81 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 rust/kernel/fs/sb.rs            |  6 +++
 4 files changed, 113 insertions(+)

